# Byte-pinned Horizons DE441 Sun/Moon snapshots: prevent git from rewriting the content.
# These files are byte-identical to the cached Horizons API response and must not be
# modified; their identity is the byte-for-byte SHA-256 pinned in MANIFEST.json.
#
# NOTE (2026-10-03): the patterns in this file were previously written repo-root-relative
# ("research/orbital-mechanics/missions/mission_lunisolar_closure/reference/..."). A
# nested .gitattributes resolves its patterns RELATIVE TO ITS OWN DIRECTORY, so they
# matched nothing and `git check-attr text` reported `unspecified` for every one of these
# files: the protection was silently inert. They are now written dir-relative, and are
# ALSO duplicated in the repository-root .gitattributes so that the guarantee does not
# depend on this file being present. Kept here as well so the file is self-describing.
reference/horizons_sun_geocentric_vectors_2026_to_2045_icrf_tdb_daily.txt -text
reference/horizons_moon_geocentric_vectors_2026_to_2045_icrf_tdb_daily.txt -text
reference/per_chunk/*.txt -text
reference/MANIFEST.json -text